        <p>L - Warrington v. Huddersfield. These wan a capital holiday crowd of :•,000 people to witness the hist lasgue match of the FeMCP at War- rington sin Monday. Huddersfield Igene the visitors and they brought a ponerful tend %Lb them. War• rington were also well repreasnted, Shugart; heing the only absentee. and Skelhorne filling the vacancy. Great intereat was shown in the mach locally, as the York- shire men have won entry League mach alone the New Year, sod accomplished souse ph,tuntenal scoring. Teams and officials</p>
