        <p>At Widnei on Thtiriday,Pe ter end C.lLe,ite Mitehell of Broughton Cluing., biltnn, were charged together with neglecting their fire children in such • mintier an to citric them unneceiniry suffering tend injury to health. Mr. I've] appeared for the National Society for the Prevention of Guilty to Children to pediecute, mid said that this case had been °eider the °beery/glen of the inspector since I 900. nay had been warned time after time. 'lle husband on, in good envied men', end gave ti wife 325. a week, and appeared to tuner fairly de.'ent torn. 11, Belted their worships to deal severely with the woman, a, she essicontintinlly out drirking, the women ties sentenced to too inenths, And the man was bound over for six months, ins sum of £lO.</p>
