        <head>SCENE IN A SCHOOL.</head>
        <p>SCENE IN A SCHOOL.</p>
        <p>PARENT FINED FOR STRIKING TEACHER. Edith Millington, IGS, Orford-lane, Warrington, sves summoned at the Warrineton Police Court en Thursday morning for assaulting Margaret Carter Sirneecit. Mr A T Ha newsy (deputy town clerk), stated that the complainant was • teacher in the Besmont Council School. It appeared that on the morning of April sth the teacher had °cession to punish time dtughter ' of the defendant for untruthfulness. She received one stroke no the "strap" end it one duty recorded in the punishment book. In the afternoon the defendant came to the school, walked into the classroom wheys Miss Simcock was teaching, and in front of the whole school struck her a Mow on the chest, follow ing up this with S steam] of abusive language. wc •</p>
        <p>This statement %as corroborated by Miss Simeock, •hn stated tbat defendant's daughter had been previously punished for untruthfulness. Defendent stoutly deniod thut sheet ruck the teacher. The Magistrates raid theauthorities must have power to conduct the school as they tin tight proper 'then did not wish to be hard, end only • line of 21 6d would be imposed.</p>
