      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1911-04-22_WidnesExaminer_art0074" n="art0074">
        <head>NATIONAL REVENUE.</head>
        <p>THE NATIONAL REVENUE.</p>
        <p>The Exchequer statement for the period from April 1 to April 15 last stows that the revenue =corned to £9,521,037, umpired with £5,414,310 in the correspond- ing part of fast year. 'I he priecir al incr.on woo is tie Tem mt. from property and income tax, which ameuted to £4,159,000, against £319,CL0. The revenue from came, be., duties also iocrimied considerably, •niount- ing to £1,167,0015 against £659,100. The expenditure amounted to £10,734,41D0t rusted with £12,756,641.</p>
