        <p>The Faster vesl,y meeting was held on Tuesday even- ing. The Vicar (the Rev. E. C. E. Cerletont presided over an attendance of shoot 12 person., among whom were Messrs. W. Gill (vicar's warden) John flesketh, (people's warden) and G. F. F. White (clerk.)</p>
