        <p>tipple in's small So• Jtch. )1%111 Ilinierstand. .1 order the whieky tirst thing, and, resting the enthrella in • spittoon, I take the earliest epportimity to empty my gi.sB lido the umbrella, and there you WO !</p>
        <p>of roman, I could not posobly dunk of absorbsng the rubbi:4l myself, you know:'</p>
